SUMMARY:Brians Seniors Exercise Class
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nBrian is offering his focused exercise prog
 ram for Seniors once again. Any questions\, please call Brian or post in C
 omments below. This class will be restricted to four participants and will
  be ON-GOING on Tuesdays from 10:00 - 10:45.\n402 Indian Springs Tr (Edney
 ville)\, Hendersonville\, NC\n(828) 595-1455\nBring your water bottle\,\nW
 ear loose-fitting comfortable clothes.\nDonations accepted\, but not manda
 tory.\nNot everyone will be doing the same thing (Depends on individual ne
 eds)\nIf you’re not sure if this is for you\, just come and observe the 
 class.\nInvest in your health – exercise regularly. Combat premature agi
 ng.\nClass consists of:\nFunctional mobility & flexibility\, an Exercise b
 all\, Stretch band resistance exercise.
